</Positioned>
<Positioned left="80" top="164" width="1072" height="64">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="24" color="#475569" textAlign="LEFT" fontStyle="NORMAL" width="1072"><Raw><![CDATA[先分清滤镜读取的对象，再检查边界、裁剪与布局；最后保存可重放的完整证据链。]]></Raw></Text>
</Positioned>
